\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Spread, O spread, thou mighty word,
\par Spread the kingdom of the Lord,
\par Whereso'er His breath has given
\par Life to beings meant for heaven.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Word of life, most pure and strong,
\par Lo! for thee the nations long;
\par Spread, till from its dreary night
\par All the world awakes to light.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Up! the ripening fields ye see,
\par Mighty shall the harvest be;
\par But the reapers still are few,
\par Great the work they have to do.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Lord of harvest, let there be 
\par Joy and strength to work for Thee,
\par Till the nations far and near
\par See Thy light and learn Thy fear.
\par Amen.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

